License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

It is an unofficial compatibility patch between Combat Extended
(https://github.com/CombatExtended-Continued/CombatExtended), which is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, and
Vanilla Gravship Expanded by the Vanilla Expanded team (https://github.com/Vanilla-Expanded). It calls both
through Harmony and inheritance. A few short pieces follow VGE's code closely so VGE's behaviour carries over to CE
projectiles: the asteroid and debris spawn methods (Source/Patches/SpaceProjectileSpawn.cs), their impact loot
(Source/Projectiles/ProjectileCE_VGESpace.cs) and the point-defence intercept chance
(Source/Patches/VGEPointDefence.cs). Vanilla Gravship Expanded and Combat Extended belong to their authors; this
license covers only this patch's own work.
